# tolerances (RTL-485 ... RTL-488)
ok BOM, CRLF, leading blank lines, keyword case
ok tabs, indentation, trailing whitespace
ok no blanks around "="
ok inherited root, root type not validated, no final line end
ok csLoading cleared by Loaded
# strings (RTL-489)
ok doubled quote
ok control codes between parts
ok decimal and hex code units
ok empty string
ok non-ASCII literally
ok "+" continues on the next line
# numbers (RTL-490)
ok negative
ok hex, lower case
ok 32-bit pattern into Integer
ok lowest Integer pattern
ok 32-bit pattern into Cardinal
ok decimal Cardinal
ok highest Int64
ok lowest Int64
ok 16 hex digits
ok short hex into Int64 is unsigned
ok float
ok exponent
ok small exponent
ok integer into a float
# syntax errors (RTL-491, RTL-500)
ok invalid character
ok unterminated string
ok missing "="
ok missing value
ok missing end
ok decimal out of range
ok negative out of range
ok 17 hex digits
ok code unit out of range
ok "#" without digits
ok "+" not at the end of a line
ok a lone "+"
ok a lone CR
ok junk after the value
ok columns count UTF-16 units
ok CRLF line counting
ok header
ok first keyword
ok text after the root
ok csLoading cleared after an error
ok csReading cleared after an error
ok empty text
# invalid UTF-8 (RTL-485)
ok truncated sequence
ok overlong form
ok encoded surrogate
ok invalid lead byte
ok BOM skipped
# passed 52 failed 0
